# Naming check disabled for this directory only.
#
# mps_reader.cpp and solu_reader.cpp are vendored from spoorendonk/mipx and
# carry a "port the diff here and bump the last synced commit" contract in
# their headers. Upstream spells its helpers camelBack (`parseReal`,
# `isSection`, `parseSection`), so renaming them to this project's lower_case
# would put a permanent, purely cosmetic delta between the two trees and make
# the next sync harder to review -- against the Reference Correctness rule in
# CLAUDE.md. Four findings, all in the vendored readers.
#
# Everything else in the root .clang-tidy still applies here; only the naming
# check is off. The tradeoff is that the three native adapters in this
# directory (mps_to_model.cpp, nl_to_model.cpp, nl_reader.cpp) also lose naming
# coverage -- they are clean today, so keep an eye on new code here.
---
Checks: >
  -readability-identifier-naming
